Kare-raice at fried chicken.

155
00:10:29,266 --> 00:10:32,983
Ang fried chicken talaga masarap, 'di ba?

156
00:10:33,007 --> 00:10:37,273
Oo. Ang laman, malambot.

157
00:10:37,296 --> 00:10:43,030
Ah, may bakasyon sa unibersidad sa susunod na linggo.

158
00:10:43,053 --> 00:10:46,619
